   325→    acceptance_criteria:
   326→      - id: ac-1
   327→        given: daemon is running
   328→        when: request from allowed CORS origin received
   329→        then: CORS headers allow the request (origins configured for dev and production)
   330→      - id: ac-2
   331→        given: daemon is running
   332→        when: GET /api/tasks is called
   333→        then: returns JSON array of all tasks with status, priority, spec_ref, notes count
   334→      - id: ac-3
   335→        given: daemon is running
   336→        when: GET /api/tasks with status filter (e.g., ?status=pending&status=in_progress)
   337→        then: returns only tasks matching filter (supports multi-value)
   338→      - id: ac-4
