  1124→      Task cards show key metadata, clicking opens detail modal.
  1125→      Not drag-and-drop — tasks transition via agents/CLI.
  1126→    acceptance_criteria:
  1127→      - id: ac-1
  1128→        given: |
  1129→          Tasks in various states
  1130→        when: |
