  1132→        then: |
  1133→          Tasks are distributed into columns: Backlog (pending, manual_only/unassessed),
  1134→          Ready (pending, eligible), In Progress (in_progress, needs_work),
  1135→          Review (pending_review), Done (completed recent), with blocked and cancelled
  1136→          handled as sections/indicators
