  1532→  - _ulid: 01KJZH33ZQ6DS7KTNFCRBBBBVX
  1533→    slugs:
  1534→      - e2e-test-daemon-isolation
  1535→    title: E2E Test Daemon Isolation
  1536→    type: requirement
  1537→    tags:
  1538→      - test
  1539→      - daemon
  1540→      - e2e
  1541→      - web-ui
  1542→    description: E2E (Playwright) tests must never interfere with user-invoked or other daemons. Tests
  1543→      must use ephemeral ports, isolated HOME/config, and deterministic cleanup — never killing
  1544→      processes by port number. This extends the vitest isolation patterns from
  1545→      @daemon-sensitive-cli-test-determinism to the Playwright E2E test infrastructure.
  1546→    depends_on: []
  1547→    implements: []
  1548→    relates_to: []
  1549→    tests: []
  1550→    traits: []
  1551→    notes: []
  1552→    created: 2026-03-05T17:35:25.175Z
  1553→    acceptance_criteria:
  1554→      - id: ac-1
  1555→        given: E2E tests need a daemon for API/browser testing
  1556→        when: the Playwright test fixture starts a daemon
  1557→        then: the daemon binds to an ephemeral port (OS-assigned, port 0) so it never conflicts with user
  1558→          daemons or parallel test runs
  1559→      - id: ac-2
  1560→        given: a daemon is running on the default port (3456) before tests start
  1561→        when: E2E tests execute
  1562→        then: the user's daemon is never killed, stopped, or interfered with — tests use their own isolated
  1563→          port
  1564→      - id: ac-3
  1565→        given: E2E tests start a daemon in a temp directory
  1566→        when: the test fixture sets up the daemon environment
  1567→        then: HOME and config paths are isolated so daemon PID/port state does not leak to or from the
  1568→          ambient system
  1569→      - id: ac-4
  1570→        given: E2E tests complete (pass or fail)
  1571→        when: the Playwright test fixture tears down
  1572→        then: the test daemon is stopped via scoped kspec serve stop (not process killing) and temp
  1573→          directories are cleaned up
  1574→      - id: ac-5
  1575→        given: the test daemon port is dynamically assigned
  1576→        when: Playwright tests make API calls or navigate browser pages
  1577→        then: the port is propagated to all test fixtures and page URLs via the daemon fixture context
  1578→    status:
  1579→      maturity: draft
  1580→      implementation: implemented
